<logentry><text>09/02/2011 02:41:55 PM CN=Marlene Okafor/OU=CHPSID/O=TACOM added Heraldry-Vendors</text></logentry>
<logentry><text>06/11/2013 09:03:31 AM CN=Domino Developer/O=HAAS added role [SESApprover]</text></logentry>
<logentry><text>02/22/2016 11:17:02 AM CN=Marlene Okafor/OU=CHPSID/O=TACOM added DLA-TroopSupport-Heraldry</text></logentry>
<logentry><text>10/30/2019 04:55:48 PM CN=Marlene Okafor/OU=CHPSID/O=TACOM added HAAS-Auditors</text></logentry>
<logentry><text>01/03/2025 04:14:55 PM CN=HAAS-APP01/O=TACOM updated Anonymous</text></logentry>
</acl>
